{
  "slug": "claude-vitals",
  "name": "Claude Vitals",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Real-time session vitals for Claude Code. Shows context window health with color-coded progress bar, active tools with aggregated counts, running agents with type/model/elapsed time, todo progress, git status, cost estimation, and rate limit usage with reset countdowns. Adaptive layout auto-detects terminal width. Reactive sections only show when relevant. Zero dependencies, zero config required.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command**, `configure` (Open or create the claude-vitals config file for customization).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-vitals@claude-community` from `ICXCNIKAanon/claude-vitals`.\n\nReal-time session vitals for Claude Code. Context health, active tools, running agents, cost, rate limits — always visible below your input.",
